# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
#   4. Click the button to generate/reveal your demo key
#   5. Copy the key below (note: demo keys have a daily reset limit and are not for production)
#
# For production, create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Required APIs:
#   - Maps JavaScript API
#   - Map Tiles API (Photorealistic 3D Tiles)
#   - Places API (New)
#   - Elevation API
# Restrict your key to HTTP referrers and these designated APIs:
#   https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
